# CampusFlow AI: An LLM-Powered Academic Task Planning and Deadline Management System

PROJECT_NAME="CampusFlow AI: An LLM-Powered Academic Task Planning and Deadline Management System"
PROJECT_DESCRIPTION="CampusFlow AI is an LLM-powered system that converts academic announcements, assignments, and schedules into organized tasks. It identifies deadlines, prioritizes tasks, detects scheduling conflicts, and generates personalized study plans. It also provides reminders, progress tracking, and dynamic schedule updates, helping students manage responsibilities and avoid missed deadlines."

# Database Configuration (PostgreSQL primary, auto-fallback to SQLite for local development)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg2://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/campusflow_db
# Set USE_SQLITE_FALLBACK=true to automatically use SQLite if PostgreSQL is not running
USE_SQLITE_FALLBACK=true

# Security & Authentication
JWT_SECRET=campusflow_super_secret_jwt_key_academic_task_planner_2026
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=1440

# Google Gemini API
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# OCR & File Processing
TESSERACT_CMD=
UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads

# CORS
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173,http://localhost:3000
